{"ref":"BDB, עֶ֫רֶשׂ","hw":"עֶ֫רֶשׂ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֶ֫רֶשׂ</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 7:13\" href=\"/Job.7.13\">Jb 7:13</a></sup> <strong>couch, divan</strong>;—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.11\">Dt 3:11</a> +; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָ֑רֶשׂ</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:12\" href=\"/Amos.3.12\">Am 3:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַרְשִׂי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:13\" href=\"/Job.7.13\">Jb 7:13</a> +, etc.; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַרְשׂוֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:4\" href=\"/Amos.6.4\">Am 6:4</a>;—<em>couch, divan</em>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:12\" href=\"/Amos.3.12\">Am 3:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:4\" href=\"/Amos.6.4\">6:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטּוֹת</span>), + <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:28\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.28\">2 S 17:28</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">עַרְשׂת מִשְׁכָּב</span> Klo Ne<sup>Marg. 18</sup> HPS, cf. 𝔊); for lying at night <a data-ref=\"Job 7:13\" href=\"/Job.7.13\">Jb 7:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:7\" href=\"/Psalms.6.7\">ψ 6:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִטָּה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.16\">Pr 7:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶרֶשׂ יְצוּעָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:3\" href=\"/Psalms.132.3\">ψ 132:3</a> <em>the couch of</em> (consisting in) <em>my bed;</em> couch of sickness <a data-ref=\"Psalms 41:4\" href=\"/Psalms.41.4\">ψ 41:4</a>; marriage couch <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:16\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.16\">Ct 1:16</a>; perhaps transf. to sarcophagus, as last couch <span dir=\"rtl\">עַרְשׂוֹ עֶרֶשׂ בַּרְזֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.11\">Dt 3:11</a> (v. Dr).","next":"BDB, ערשׁ","prev":"BDB, ערשׂ"}